{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XjhFoGqrWmgm6iSEbmWzPZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1和Claim 3被接受为solid empirical contributions；Claim 2的meta-critique被1-2位reviewers视为\n2\t  \"well-known but under-documented limitation\"——需在rebuttal中补充5+篇使用web-overlap labels做item-level\n3\t  validation的具体引用以证明field确实在犯这个错误；Claim 4的actionability论证依赖plan_032的z=8.5 random baseline对比，但至少1位reviewer质疑cohort\n4\t  asymmetry可能反映model quality confound而非DIF-specific effect；ρ=0.997的\"instability ≠\n5\t  invalidity\"张力在Introduction中upfront framing帮助了，但1位reviewer 仍写\"if the rankings are\n6\t  this stable, the practical significance of 31% instability is unclear\"。Rebuttal策略：用plan_030\n7\t  Simpson''s paradox作为\"models got better ≠ items changed\" 的defense line；用plan_029\n8\t  permutation null（p<0.001）正面回应\"is 31% above chance\"； HellaSwag/GSM8K较低C%（17-19%）的解释需补充benchmark\n9\t  structural differences（item count, domain homogeneity）。整体需要strong rebuttal + 1个supplementary\n10\t  experiment（per-family stratified permutation）才能从3.5推到4.0 Conference accept线。Claims\n11\t  1和3 accepted without major caveat； Claim 2需要additional prior work citations；Claim\n12\t  4需要降低prescriptive tone。 页面压缩从10→8页导致plan_018 threshold sensitivity table和plan_022\n13\t  de-duplication detail 被移入appendix，1位reviewer要求在main text恢复threshold robustness summary。\n14\t\n15\t  '\n16\timagined_experiments:\n17\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n18\t  plan_id: plan_001\n19\t  description: '对METABENCH MMLU响应矩阵（5219模型×12508题目）进行MH-DIF分析。包括temporal cohort split\n20\t    (2023 vs 2024-H1)、ability-quintile split、within-family confound control (Llama-2\n21\t    vs Llama-3)、domain-specificity分析、Li et al. web-overlap proxy验证。\n22\t\n23\t    '\n24\t  expected_results:\n25\t    temporal_cohort:\n26\t      n_ref: 1080\n27\t      n_foc: 807\n28\t      ets_c_pct: 31.3\n29\t      ets_b_pct: 20.5\n30\t      ets_a_pct: 48.2\n31\t      mean_delta_mh_c_items: 2.14\n32\t      median_delta_mh_c_items: 1.78\n33\t    ability_cohort:\n34\t      ets_c_pct: 2.9\n35\t      enrichment: 1.19\n36\t    within_family:\n37\t      llama2_vs_llama3_c_pct: 61.3\n38\t      mistral_vs_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n39\t      llama_jaccard_with_temporal: 0.28\n40\t    domain_specificity:\n41\t      spearman_rho_acc_improvement_vs_c_pct: 0.307\n42\t      spearman_p: 0.02\n43\t      n_subjects: 57\n44\t      all_subjects_have_dif: true\n45\t      c_pct_range:\n46\t      - 20.7\n47\t      - 48.4\n48\t    proxy_validation:\n49\t      li_et_al_coverage: 0.738\n50\t      enrichment_temporal: 0.96\n51\t      fpr_li_clean_temporal: 0.318\n52\t      enrichment_ability: 1.19\n53\t      fpr_li_clean_ability: 0.027\n54\t    sanity_check:\n55\t      random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n56\t      temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n57\t  result_rationale: '在median档位下，31.3% C%是核心发现，被Claim 1直接支撑。Reviewers接受这个数字的statistical\n58\t    significance（random split仅0.18%），但至少1位reviewer要求更强的causal language hedging—— 因为within-family分析（Llama-2\n59\t    vs Llama-3 C%=61.3%）显示family-level capability jump也会 产生高DIF，temporal cohort的31.3%可能混合了genuine\n60\t    item instability和capability-driven DIF。 ρ=0.307的domain-level correlation被接受为modest\n61\t    ecological correlation，但reviewer要求 明确\"item-level decomposition shows only 2.4pp\n62\t    explained\"（来自plan_019/030）。 Enrichment≈0.96支撑Claim 2但被1位reviewer视为\"expected by\n63\t    construction\"。Ability cohort 的2.9% C%作为negative control被接受。\n64\t\n65\t    '\n66\t  tables:\n67\t  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary'\n68\t    content: '4-way sensitivity matrix: cohort × item filtering → C% values'\n69\t  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-Specificity'\n70\t    content: 57 subjects × C% × accuracy improvement correlation\n71\t  figures_description:\n72\t  - 'Figure 1: DIF flag distribution across 57 MMLU subjects (heatmap), showing uniform\n73\t    spread with excess in professional_law, human_aging, business_ethics'\n74\t  - 'Figure 2: Enrichment scatter — DIF C flags vs Li et al. web-overlap labels, showing\n75\t    near-unity enrichment with annotation explaining expected independence'\n76\t  analysis: '核心结果solid。Median档reviewers的主要friction点：(1) within-family Llama-2v3的C%=61.3%\n77\t    远高于temporal 31.3%，需要解释为什么family comparison不是更好的design；(2) domain ρ=0.307 虽然p=0.02但effect\n78\t    size modest，需要plan_019 item-level decomposition作为补充； (3) Li et al. proxy validation的\"negative\n79\t    result\"需要更清晰的framing——是validation failure 还是expected orthogonality。8页压缩下within-family\n80\t    detail可能被移入appendix。\n81\t\n82\t    '\n83\t- name: rl_robustness_validation\n84\t  plan_id: plan_002\n85\t  description: '验证DIF对reasoning-RL模型的鲁棒性。从METABENCH筛选alignment-RL模型（DPO/ORPO，N≈477），\n86\t    外加10-15个open-weight reasoning-RL模型（GRPO/PPO），测试DIF检测稳定性并与传统检测器对比。\n87\t\n88\t    '\n89\t  expected_results:\n90\t    alignment_rl_cohort:\n91\t      n_models: 477\n92\t      c_pct_with_alignment_rl: 31.1\n93\t      c_pct_without: 31.3\n94\t      jaccard_flags_overlap: 0.968\n95\t      flag_stability: negligible change\n96\t    reasoning_rl_models:\n97\t      n_available: 13\n98\t      models_tested:\n99\t      - deepseek-r1-7b\n100\t      - deepseek-r1-32b\n101\t      - qwen2.5-rl-7b\n102\t      - qwen2.5-rl-14b\n103\t      - qwen2.5-rl-32b\n104\t      - o1-mini-proxy\n105\t      - skywork-or1-8b\n106\t      - open-reasoner-7b\n107\t      - marco-o1-7b\n108\t      - k2-65b\n109\t      - rstar-math-7b\n110\t      - still-2-1.5b\n111\t      - llemma-rl-7b\n112\t      c_pct_with_rl_in_focal: 31.0\n113\t      c_pct_change: -0.3\n114\t      jaccard_with_vs_without_rl: 0.971\n115\t    traditional_detector_comparison:\n116\t      mink_auroc_non_rl: 0.714\n117\t      mink_auroc_rl_models: 0.528\n118\t      mink_auroc_delta: -0.186\n119\t      constat_auroc_non_rl: 0.681\n120\t      constat_auroc_rl_models: 0.513\n121\t      constat_auroc_delta: -0.168\n122\t      dif_retention_ratio: 0.987\n123\t    statistical_tests:\n124\t      delong_mink_p: 0.089\n125\t      delong_constat_p: 0.112\n126\t      tost_equivalence: 'inconclusive (CI: [-0.04, 0.07], bounds ±0.10)'\n127\t      bootstrap_ci_dif_retention:\n128\t      - 0.93\n129\t      - 1.03\n130\t    power_analysis:\n131\t      partial_exploitation_p04: delta_MH≈0.84, TPR≈0.31\n132\t      partial_exploitation_p07: delta_MH≈1.18, TPR≈0.52\n133\t      partial_exploitation_p10: delta_MH≈1.68, TPR≈0.76\n134\t      detection_boundary: p≈0.55 for TPR≥0.50 at N=100\n135\t  result_rationale: 'Median档位的关键限制：reasoning-RL模型仅13个，远低于统计显著性所需的样本量。DIF是group-level\n136\t    方法，将13个RL模型混入N≈807的focal cohort几乎不改变C%（31.3%→31.0%），但这也意味着无法 单独评估RL模型的DIF特性。传统检测器（Min-K%，ConStat）在RL模型上的AUROC下降（0.71→0.53,\n137\t    0.68→0.51），方向支持\"DIF比per-model方法更robust\"的claim，但DeLong test p>0.05因为N=13 power不足。TOST等价性检验inconclusive——CI包含零但也包含meaningful\n138\t    differences。 在median档下，这个实验被降级到Limitations section作为\"directional evidence\"， reviewers接受reasoning-RL是emerging\n139\t    phenomenon、数据有限的framing，但1位reviewer 标注\"this weakens the practical relevance claim\n140\t    for post-2024 models\"。\n141\t\n142\t    '\n143\t  tables:\n144\t  - name: 'Table S1 (Appendix): RL Robustness Comparison'\n145\t    content: AUROC comparison across DIF/Min-K%/ConStat × model type (non-RL, alignment-RL,\n146\t      reasoning-RL)\n147\t  figures_description:\n148\t  - 'Figure S1: Detection power curve as function of exploitation rate p ∈ [0.4, 1.0],\n149\t    showing DIF maintains >0.50 TPR at p≥0.55 while Min-K% drops below 0.50 at p≤0.7'\n150\t  analysis: 'N=13是致命弱点。实验方向正确但statistical power不足以支撑numbered claim。 Median档策略：在limitations中honest\n151\t    disclosure \"reasoning-RL robustness remains an open question due to limited open-weight\n152\t    availability\"，同时在main text保留 alignment-RL的positive result（N=477，C% stable at 31.1%）作为partial\n153\t    evidence。 Reviewer不会因此reject但会在score中扣分（contributes to 3.25-3.75 range）。\n154\t\n155\t    '\n156\t- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n157\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n158\t  description: '独立评估ConStat-style perturbation testing在MMLU上的检测力。需要GPU生成语义等价 reformulations并收集模型响应。\n159\t\n160\t    '\n161\t  expected_results:\n162\t    status: not_executed\n163\t    reason: GPU budget constraint (80h required) + 依赖LLM paraphrasing pipeline未搭建\n164\t    counterfactual_if_executed:\n165\t      n_items_reformulated: 250\n166\t      constat_fdr_controlled_detection_rate: 0.42\n167\t      constat_auroc_non_rl: 0.68\n168\t      constat_auroc_rl: 0.51\n169\t      constat_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.18\n170\t      constat_specificity: high for verbatim contamination, low for capability-driven\n171\t        DIF\n172\t  result_rationale: '在median档位下，plan_003a未执行是合理的——paper已pivot away from ensemble detection\n173\t    (Claim 2 old) toward diagnostic framing。GPU预算优先分配给plan_002和plan_004。 ConStat/DVD的AUROC数字已通过文献引用在main\n174\t    text中提供（Blebea et al. 2024）， 无需独立复现。Reviewers可能要求\"why not compare directly\"但rebuttal可以指向\n175\t    ConStat的public results + 不同detection targets（perturbation sensitivity vs differential\n176\t    functioning）的conceptual argument。在median档下这不构成reject reason 但contributes to \"thin\n177\t    empirical comparison\" concern。\n178\t\n179\t    '\n180\t  tables: []\n181\t  figures_description: []\n182\t  analysis: '未执行。对median档outcome的影响：1位reviewer在minor comments中提到\"direct comparison\n183\t    with ConStat would strengthen the paper\"，但接受conceptual distinction argument。 不是core\n184\t    weakness。\n185\t\n186\t    '\n187\t- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n188\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n189\t  description: '独立评估DVD generation variance在MMLU上的检测力。需要GPU对10-15个模型生成50次响应。\n190\t\n191\t    '\n192\t  expected_results:\n193\t    status: not_executed\n194\t    reason: GPU budget constraint (70h required) + 需要open-weight model inference pipeline\n195\t    counterfactual_if_executed:\n196\t      n_models: 12\n197\t      responses_per_item: 50\n198\t      dvd_detection_rate: 0.35\n199\t      dvd_auroc: 0.62\n200\t      dvd_variant_contamination_sensitivity: 0.71\n201\t      dvd_verbatim_contamination_sensitivity: 0.44\n202\t  result_rationale: '与plan_003a相同逻辑——paper不再追求ensemble detection，DVD作为independent\n203\t    baseline 的value在current framing下降低。Median档reviewers理解GPU constraint但可能在 \"comparison\n204\t    with existing methods\" section标注insufficiency。Rebuttal中可指向 DVD原始论文结果 + \"DIF operates\n205\t    at group level while DVD operates at model level, complementary rather than competing\"。\n206\t\n207\t    '\n208\t  tables: []\n209\t  figures_description: []\n210\t  analysis: '未执行。影响与plan_003a类似，合并为一个reviewer concern：\"existing method comparison\n211\t    is conceptual rather than empirical\"。Median档下这是minor issue，不影响accept/reject。\n212\t\n213\t    '\n214\t- name: ensemble_fusion\n215\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n216\t  description: '融合DIF + ConStat + DVD为多信号ensemble。依赖plan_003a和plan_003b。\n217\t\n218\t    '\n219\t  expected_results:\n220\t    status: not_executed\n221\t    reason: Dependencies plan_003a and plan_003b not executed; ensemble claim dropped\n222\t      from paper\n223\t    paper_status: Dropped to future work section\n224\t  result_rationale: 'Plan_003c在paper pivot后被完全dropped。Paper从\"we detect contamination\n225\t    better via ensemble\"转向\"we characterize benchmark properties via DIF\"。Median档reviewers\n226\t    不会miss这个experiment因为paper不再claim ensemble contribution。但1位reviewer 可能在\"future\n227\t    work\"评论中写\"the ensemble direction seems promising and its absence weakens the practical\n228\t    impact\"——这contributes to actionability concern。\n229\t\n230\t    '\n231\t  tables: []\n232\t  figures_description: []\n233\t  analysis: '完全dropped。无直接影响，但间接加剧Claim 4 actionability的weakness——如果ensemble 存在，actionability\n234\t    story会更强。Median档下这是background weakness，不是explicit reviewer complaint。\n235\t\n236\t    '\n237\t- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n238\t  plan_id: plan_004\n239\t  description: '在GSM8K上复现DIF分析，使用GSM1K作为contamination ground truth。包括temporal DIF、\n240\t    semi-synthetic validation、GSM1K correlation三步。\n241\t\n242\t    '\n243\t  expected_results:\n244\t    step1_temporal_dif:\n245\t      n_items: 1319\n246\t      n_ref: 1017\n247\t      n_foc: 804\n248\t      standard_c_pct: 18.9\n249\t      external_c_pct: 47.4\n250\t      sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n251\t      standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n252\t    step2_semi_synthetic:\n253\t      standard_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n254\t      standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n255\t      external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n256\t      fpr_stable: true\n257\t    step3_gsm1k_correlation:\n258\t      n_matched_models: 33\n259\t      pearson_r: -0.478\n260\t      pearson_p: 0.005\n261\t      spearman_rho: -0.403\n262\t      spearman_p: 0.02\n263\t      partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.385\n264\t      partial_p: 0.027\n265\t      direction: NEGATIVE — opposite to naive contamination hypothesis\n266\t      interpretation: DIF-C items ANTI-correlate with contamination gap; DIF captures\n267\t        capability differential, not contamination per se\n268\t      ci_95_pearson:\n269\t      - -0.71\n270\t      - -0.16\n271\t      ci_95_spearman:\n272\t      - -0.66\n273\t      - -0.03\n274\t      cook_d_max: deepseek-math-7b-rl\n275\t      leave_one_out_robust: true\n276\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K的C%=18.9%显著低于MMLU的31.3%，在median档下被1位reviewer质疑为\"DIF may\n277\t    be benchmark-specific — lower rates on math benchmarks suggest the phenomenon\n278\t    is modulated by domain characteristics\"。这是valid concern因为GSM8K是单领域数学题， item homogeneity高于MMLU的57-subject结构。GSM1K\n279\t    correlation的r=-0.478方向为负 （与contamination hypothesis相反），被demoted to exploratory\n280\t    per Dream #6 consensus。 N=33 + wide CI [-0.71, -0.16]使这个结果在median档下不被视为strong\n281\t    evidence。 Semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818则是positive result，支撑Claim 3的framework portability。\n282\t    Median档下Step 2被接受，Step 3被标注\"exploratory, underpowered\"。\n283\t\n284\t    '\n285\t  tables:\n286\t  - name: 'Table 3: Cross-Benchmark DIF Summary'\n287\t    content: 'GSM8K temporal DIF: C%=18.9%, ΔTPR=+0.818, GSM1K r=-0.478'\n288\t  figures_description:\n289\t  - 'Figure 3: GSM8K DIF detection power curve (ΔTPR vs injection rate p), showing\n290\t    monotonic increase with cross-subject matching maintaining ΔFPR≈0'\n291\t  analysis: 'Mixed result。Semi-synthetic validation强化Claim 3，但GSM1K negative correlation\n292\t    + lower C%创造了tension。Median档reviewers接受\"DIF captures differential functioning\n293\t    broadly, not just contamination\"的framing，但GSM1K result被从abstract/conclusion 移除。HellaSwag\n294\t    C%=17.9%（来自plan_028）进一步支持\"lower rates on non-MMLU benchmarks\" 的pattern，给reviewer\n295\t    ammunition质疑MMLU-specificity。\n296\t\n297\t    '\n298\t- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n299\t  plan_id: plan_005\n300\t  description: '在MMLU上拟合bifactor IRT模型（general factor + 57 subject-specific factors），选择\n301\t    anchor items进行fixed-parameter calibration equating。\n302\t\n303\t    '\n304\t  expected_results:\n305\t    status: attempted_and_killed\n306\t    convergence:\n307\t      full_57_subject: failed to converge after 5000 EM iterations\n308\t      reduced_10_subject: converged but poor fit\n309\t      reduced_5_subject: converged, marginal fit\n310\t    fit_statistics_5_subject:\n311\t      rmsea: 0.078\n312\t      cfi: 0.724\n313\t      tli: 0.698\n314\t      srmr: 0.091\n315\t    anchor_item_selection:\n316\t      n_candidate_anchors: 312\n317\t      anchor_stability_criterion: DIF A-class + discrimination > 0.8\n318\t      anchor_coverage: 38/57 subjects represented\n319\t    equating_pilot:\n320\t      status: abandoned — fit insufficient for reliable equating\n321\t      rho_equated_vs_original: null\n322\t      decision: killed; within-subject DIF (plan_014) provides alternative without\n323\t        requiring full IRT model\n324\t  result_rationale: 'Bifactor IRT在MMLU上失败是structurally predictable的：57个subjects ×\n325\t    12508 items的 bifactor model需要估计~57 specific factors + 1 general factor + ~25000\n326\t    item parameters， 计算上不可行且psychometrically questionable（MMLU的57 subjects不是designed\n327\t    dimensions）。 在median档下，这个failure被report为\"empirical observation that motivates\n328\t    future multidimensional IRT work\"，positioned as honest negative result。Plan_014的\n329\t    within-subject DIF（C%=38.1%）提供了alternative path证明DIF不依赖于cross-subject matching\n330\t    artifact。Reviewer可能质疑\"why attempt bifactor at all\"但不会因failure 扣分——negative results是legitimate\n331\t    contribution if honestly reported。\n332\t\n333\t    '\n334\t  tables: []\n335\t  figures_description: []\n336\t  analysis: 'Expected failure。在median档下被移入limitations section作为\"our attempts to improve\n337\t    IRT model specification did not succeed, but within-subject validation (plan_014)\n338\t    confirms DIF findings are not artifacts of cross-subject matching\"。Contributes\n339\t    to the \"three structural constraints\" narrative。不直接影响reviewer score。\n340\t\n341\t    '\n342\t- name: item_generation_calibration\n343\t  plan_id: plan_006\n344\t  description: '为DIF-flagged MMLU items生成替换题目，通过student simulation进行difficulty calibration。\n345\t\n346\t    '\n347\t  expected_results:\n348\t    status: blocked\n349\t    blocking_dependency: plan_005 (bifactor IRT) killed — no equating framework for\n350\t      calibration\n351\t    alternative_path: plan_032 DIF-cleaned demonstration provides actionability evidence\n352\t      without item replacement\n353\t    counterfactual_if_executed:\n354\t      n_items_generated: 500\n355\t      difficulty_correlation_prompt: 0.32\n356\t      difficulty_correlation_simulation: 0.71\n357\t      construct_fidelity_human_eval: 0.64\n358\t      replacement_set_rho_vs_original: 0.989\n359\t  result_rationale: 'Plan_006被plan_005 failure阻塞是合理的——没有可靠的IRT equating framework，\n360\t    replacement items无法calibrated到同一量表上。在median档下，paper不claim \"benchmark regeneration\"（已从original\n361\t    framing dropped），改为claim \"DIF as diagnostic lens\"。Plan_032的DIF-cleaned demonstration（89.5%\n362\t    models shift ≥5 ranks, z=8.5 vs random）提供了不需要item replacement的actionability evidence。Reviewers不会miss这个experiment因为paper不再promise\n363\t    regeneration。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t  tables: []\n367\t  figures_description: []\n368\t  analysis: 'Blocked。Paper已完全pivot away from regeneration claim。在median档下无影响。\n369\t\n370\t    '\n371\t- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n372\t  plan_id: plan_007\n373\t  description: '实现Sinharay et al. (2006)的cumulative Bayesian DIF priors，模拟4次连续benchmark\n374\t    administrations，展示累积evidence带来的power improvement。\n375\t\n376\t    '\n377\t  expected_results:\n378\t    simulation_design:\n379\t      n_administrations: 4\n380\t      n_items_per_admin: 500\n381\t      n_models_per_admin: 200\n382\t      effect_sizes:\n383\t      - 0.8\n384\t      - 1.0\n385\t      - 1.2\n386\t      - 1.4\n387\t      - 1.6\n388\t      contamination_prevalence: 0.15\n389\t    power_results:\n390\t      single_admin_tpr_d10: 0.397\n391\t      cumulative_2_admin_tpr_d10: 0.548\n392\t      cumulative_3_admin_tpr_d10: 0.681\n393\t      cumulative_4_admin_tpr_d10: 0.739\n394\t      single_admin_tpr_d14: 0.682\n395\t      cumulative_3_admin_tpr_d14: 0.841\n396\t    fpr_all_conditions: <0.06\n397\t    prior_weight_sensitivity:\n398\t      informative_prior_tpr_3admin: 0.681\n399\t      flat_prior_tpr_3admin: 0.523\n400\t      prior_impact: +0.158 TPR from informative priors\n401\t    bayes_factor_threshold:\n402\t      bf_gt_3_pct_3admin: 0.58\n403\t      bf_gt_10_pct_3admin: 0.41\n404\t  result_rationale: 'Cumulative Bayesian DIF在simulation中表现符合预期：3次administration后power从0.40\n405\t    提升到0.68（δ=1.0），符合Sinharay et al.的理论预测。但这是pure simulation——没有在 real METABENCH data上进行temporal\n406\t    sliding window validation。在median档下， 这个experiment被放入appendix作为\"methodological\n407\t    extension for longitudinal benchmark monitoring\"。Reviewers将其视为incremental：1位reviewer写\"the\n408\t    Bayesian accumulation is a known technique; the contribution here is applying\n409\t    it to the LLM context, which is straightforward\"。Proposition 1的formal proof（cross-subject\n410\t    ΔFPR=0） 被同一位reviewer称为\"incremental\"——这两个方法贡献合并被视为不够novel。\n411\t\n412\t    '\n413\t  tables:\n414\t  - name: 'Table S2 (Appendix): Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power'\n415\t    content: TPR × n_administrations × effect_size matrix + BF threshold analysis\n416\t  figures_description:\n417\t  - 'Figure S2: Power accumulation curves across 4 administrations at δ={0.8, 1.0,\n418\t    1.2, 1.4, 1.6}, showing diminishing returns after 3rd administration'\n419\t  analysis: 'Simulation-only结果在median档下被视为supplementary。主要value是为Discussion中 \"longitudinal\n420\t    benchmark monitoring protocol\"提供quantitative grounding。 不直接影响reviewer score但strengthens\n421\t    the \"audit protocol\" narrative for Claim 4。\n422\t\n423\t    '\n424\t- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n425\t  plan_id: plan_008\n426\t  description: '分析benchmark在progressive item replacement下的validity degradation。模拟5%-50%\n427\t    replacement rate，测量ranking stability、score reliability、construct coverage。\n428\t\n429\t    '\n430\t  expected_results:\n431\t    replacement_rates:\n432\t    - 0.05\n433\t    - 0.1\n434\t    - 0.15\n435\t    - 0.2\n436\t    - 0.3\n437\t    - 0.5\n438\t    ranking_stability_rho:\n439\t      pct_05: 0.9994\n440\t      pct_10: 0.9981\n441\t      pct_15: 0.9963\n442\t      pct_20: 0.9938\n443\t      pct_30: 0.9867\n444\t      pct_50: 0.9714\n445\t    score_reliability_alpha:\n446\t      original: 0.962\n447\t      pct_05: 0.959\n448\t      pct_10: 0.955\n449\t      pct_15: 0.95\n450\t      pct_20: 0.944\n451\t      pct_30: 0.929\n452\t      pct_50: 0.898\n453\t    construct_coverage:\n454\t      pct_subjects_ge80pct_items_at_20pct: 0.947\n455\t      pct_subjects_ge80pct_items_at_50pct: 0.614\n456\t      first_subject_below_80pct: formal_logic (N=126, loses >25 items at 20%)\n457\t    theoretical_bound:\n458\t      rho_lower_bound_at_r: ρ ≥ 1 - r × (1 - α_replacement) / α_original, approximate\n459\t      validity_threshold: ρ < 0.99 at ~22% replacement for MMLU\n460\t    comparison_with_plan_032:\n461\t      plan_032_rho: 0.9965\n462\t      graceful_degradation_predicted_rho_at_31pct: 0.9856\n463\t      discrepancy: DIF-targeted removal is LESS disruptive than random replacement\n464\t        (0.9965 > 0.9856), consistent with plan_020 circularity ablation\n465\t  result_rationale: 'Graceful degradation分析在median档下支撑\"instability ≠ invalidity\"叙事：即使移除31%\n466\t    items，ρ仍>0.98（random replacement）或>0.996（DIF-targeted removal）。这与plan_017 的ρ=0.997一致。但reviewer的tension点恰恰在这里：\"if\n467\t    benchmark is this redundant, what''s the practical value of identifying unstable\n468\t    items?\"至少1位reviewer质疑 actionability——31% items unstable but rankings barely change，所以who\n469\t    cares？ Plan_032的cohort asymmetry（2024 Δrank=+73.6）是回应这个质疑的ammunition，但 在median档下论证力度不够——reviewer要求control\n470\t    for model quality confound。 Graceful degradation本身被接受为clean supplementary analysis但被移入appendix。\n471\t\n472\t    '\n473\t  tables:\n474\t  - name: 'Table S3 (Appendix): Graceful Degradation Metrics'\n475\t    content: Replacement rate × ρ × α × construct coverage matrix\n476\t  figures_description:\n477\t  - 'Figure S3: Validity degradation curves — ρ and α as function of replacement rate,\n478\t    with 95% CI bands from bootstrap'\n479\t  analysis: 'Clean supplementary result。在median档下strengthens \"instability ≠ invalidity\"\n480\t    narrative但simultaneously feeds reviewer skepticism about practical significance。\n481\t    这是median档的核心tension：数据越是显示ranking robustness，actionability argument 越难卖。\n482\t\n483\t    '\n484\t- name: item_focused_trees\n485\t  plan_id: plan_009\n486\t  description: '实现Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees作为categorical DIF的alternative，\n487\t    将model release date作为continuous covariate。\n488\t\n489\t    '\n490\t  expected_results:\n491\t    model:\n492\t      splitting_variable: release_date (continuous, days since 2023-01-01)\n493\t      tree_depth: 3\n494\t      n_terminal_nodes: 5\n495\t      primary_split: 2023-08-15 (separating early-2023 from late-2023+)\n496\t      secondary_split: 2024-02-01 (within late-2023+ group)\n497\t    dif_detection:\n498\t      n_items_significant: 3421\n499\t      pct_items_significant: 27.4\n500\t      overlap_with_mh_c: 0.823\n501\t      jaccard_with_mh_c: 0.691\n502\t      items_only_ift: 487\n503\t      items_only_mh: 984\n504\t    temporal_gradient:\n505\t      effect_size_vs_time_distance_r: 0.312\n506\t      effect_size_vs_time_distance_p: <0.001\n507\t      early_2023_vs_late_2024_mean_dif: 1.87\n508\t      adjacent_half_years_mean_dif: 0.94\n509\t    model_fit:\n510\t      deviance_explained_r2: 0.031\n511\t      aic_vs_categorical: IFT AIC=48921 vs MH-categorical AIC=49103 (marginal improvement)\n512\t    conclusion: IFT confirms temporal gradient but adds limited explanatory power\n513\t      beyond categorical MH\n514\t  result_rationale: 'IFT在median档下是\"nice to have\"的robustness check。与MH-DIF的82.3% overlap确认\n515\t    categorical temporal split不是arbitrary——continuous analysis recovers similar items。\n516\t    Primary split at ~2023-08-15大致对应LLM rapid improvement期（Llama-2 release附近）， 但R²=0.031说明release\n517\t    date alone解释DIF variation极少。Reviewer视为incremental： \"confirms the categorical finding,\n518\t    but the continuous approach doesn''t add substantial new insight\"。在median档下被移入appendix。不影响任何core\n519\t    claim但provides defense against \"arbitrary cohort split\" criticism。\n520\t\n521\t    '\n522\t  tables:\n523\t  - name: 'Table S4 (Appendix): IFT vs MH-DIF Comparison'\n524\t    content: Item overlap, detection rates, split points\n525\t  figures_description:\n526\t  - 'Figure S4: Item-Focused Tree structure showing primary split at 2023-08-15 and\n527\t    DIF effect size gradient across temporal nodes'\n528\t  analysis: 'Supplementary robustness check。Median档下reviewers不explicitly request这个分析\n529\t    但它preemptively addresses \"arbitrary cohort boundary\" concern。Value在于showing temporal\n530\t    DIF是gradient而非artifact of specific cutoff。被appendix化对page budget 有利。\n531\t\n532\t    '\n533\t- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n534\t  plan_id: plan_010\n535\t  description: '在architecture-homogeneous子群（decoder-only）上运行DIF，测试去除architecture heterogeneity是否改善IRT\n536\t    fit和减少spurious DIF。\n537\t\n538\t    '\n539\t  expected_results:\n540\t    architecture_composition:\n541\t      total_models: 5227\n542\t      decoder_only: 5226\n543\t      non_decoder: 1\n544\t      pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n545\t      non_decoder_model: instructor-xl (encoder)\n546\t    decoder_only_dif:\n547\t      c_pct: 31.3\n548\t      c_pct_change_from_full: 0.0\n549\t      jaccard_with_full: 1.0\n550\t      n_flag_changes: 2\n551\t    irt_fit_comparison:\n552\t      full_population_rmsea: 0.052\n553\t      decoder_only_rmsea: 0.052\n554\t      full_population_cfi: 0.681\n555\t      decoder_only_cfi: 0.681\n556\t      fit_change: negligible\n557\t    conclusion: Architecture heterogeneity is empirically irrelevant for METABENCH\n558\t      MMLU — population is 99.98% decoder-only\n559\t  result_rationale: '这是最clean的\"non-issue\"实验：METABENCH MMLU几乎entirely decoder-only，移除唯一一个\n560\t    non-decoder模型对C%和DIF flags毫无影响（Jaccard=1.0）。在median档下，这个result被 reviewers接受为\"architecture\n561\t    confound is not a concern for this specific dataset\"。 但IRT fit（RMSEA=0.052, CFI=0.681）仍然poor——这不是architecture问题而是MMLU本身的\n562\t    57-subject multidimensionality。Reviewers接受architecture defense但标注IRT misfit 作为general\n563\t    limitation。在median档下，这个实验在main text用一句话dismiss architecture concern，detail在appendix。\n564\t\n565\t    '\n566\t  tables:\n567\t  - name: 'Inline: Architecture composition note'\n568\t    content: 'One sentence in main text: ''METABENCH MMLU is 99.98% decoder-only (5,226/5,227);\n569\t      excluding the single encoder model changes nothing (Jaccard=1.0).'''\n570\t  figures_description: []\n571\t  analysis: 'Trivially positive result。在median档下是effective preemptive defense，占用minimal\n572\t    page space。IRT fit的poor numbers（CFI=0.681）需要在limitations中discuss，但 architecture不是原因。\n573\t\n574\t    '\n575\t- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n576\t  plan_id: plan_011\n577\t  description: '在real METABENCH response matrix中注入known contamination，测量DIF detection\n578\t    power under controlled ground truth。\n579\t\n580\t    '\n581\t  expected_results:\n582\t    temporal_external_matching:\n583\t      tpr_p0_baseline: 0.326\n584\t      tpr_p03: 0.548\n585\t      tpr_p05: 0.834\n586\t      tpr_p07: 0.99\n587\t      tpr_p10: 1.0\n588\t      fpr: 0.314\n589\t      delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n590\t      delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n591\t      delta_fpr: 0.0\n592\t    ability_external_matching:\n593\t      tpr_p0_baseline: 0.498\n594\t      tpr_p10: 0.8\n595\t      fpr: 0.493\n596\t      delta_tpr_p10: 0.302\n597\t    within_subject_matching:\n598\t      fpr_inflation_p10: '+0.186'\n599\t      matching_variable_contamination: true\n600\t    cross_subject_matching:\n601\t      delta_fpr_all_subjects: 0.0\n602\t      delta_tpr_cross_gt_within: 4/5 subjects\n603\t    injection_parameters:\n604\t      n_clean_items: 500\n605\t      n_injected_items: 150\n606\t      exploitation_rates:\n607\t      - 0.0\n608\t      - 0.3\n609\t      - 0.5\n610\t      - 0.7\n611\t      - 1.0\n612\t      focal_group_contaminated: true\n613\t  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic validation是Claim 3的core evidence，在median档下被接受as\n614\t    solid methodological contribution。ΔTPR=+0.508 at p=0.5展示meaningful detection power，\n615\t    cross-subject matching的ΔFPR=0.000是key technical insight。Median档的friction： 1位reviewer指出\"the\n616\t    injection mechanism (incorrect→correct flipping) is a simplification that may\n617\t    not reflect real contamination patterns\"——real contamination 可能改变response confidence而非binary\n618\t    correctness。这是acknowledged limitation 但不构成rejection reason。Claim 3的\"validation\n619\t    framework\"contribution被接受， 但Proposition 1的formal proof（ΔFPR=0 algebraic derivation）被1位reviewer称为\n620\t    \"follows straightforwardly from the independence of cross-subject scores and injected\n621\t    items\"——即incremental formalization。\n622\t\n623\t    '\n624\t  tables:\n625\t  - name: 'Table 4: Semi-Synthetic Validation Results'\n626\t    content: Matching strategy × injection rate → TPR/FPR/ΔTPR matrix + cross-subject\n627\t      vs within-subject comparison\n628\t  figures_description:\n629\t  - 'Figure 4: Detection power curves — ΔTPR vs injection rate p for temporal-external\n630\t    and ability-external matching, with 95% CI bands'\n631\t  - 'Figure 5: FPR stability — cross-subject matching maintains ΔFPR=0 across all\n632\t    injection rates while within-subject inflates by +0.186'\n633\t  analysis: 'Claim 3的主要evidence。Median档reviewers接受framework utility但要求更多prior work\n634\t    对比——\"how does this compare to existing semi-synthetic contamination benchmarks\n635\t    (e.g., Oren et al. 2023)?\"。Rebuttal需补充2-3个semi-synthetic prior work的 explicit\n636\t    comparison table。ΔFPR=0 across-subject matching是genuine technical contribution但formalization被视为incremental。\n637\t\n638\t    '\n639\t- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n640\t  plan_id: plan_028\n641\t  description: '在METABENCH中查找additional benchmark response matrices（ARC, HellaSwag,\n642\t    WinoGrande, TruthfulQA），运行temporal DIF分析。\n643\t\n644\t    '\n645\t  expected_results:\n646\t    benchmarks:\n647\t      mmlu:\n648\t        n_items: 12508\n649\t        n_ref: 1080\n650\t        n_foc: 807\n651\t        pct_c: 31.3\n652\t        random_pct_c: 0.18\n653\t        bootstrap_ci:\n654\t        - 29.38\n655\t        - 38.05\n656\t      winogrande:\n657\t        n_items: 1267\n658\t        n_ref: 1017\n659\t        n_foc: 803\n660\t        pct_c: 30.3\n661\t        random_pct_c: 0.32\n662\t      truthfulqa:\n663\t        n_items: 817\n664\t        n_ref: 1080\n665\t        n_foc: 807\n666\t        pct_c: 29.7\n667\t        random_pct_c: 0.37\n668\t      arc:\n669\t        n_items: 1172\n670\t        n_ref: 1080\n671\t        n_foc: 807\n672\t        pct_c: 26.9\n673\t        random_pct_c: 0.6\n674\t      gsm8k:\n675\t        n_items: 1319\n676\t        n_ref: 1017\n677\t        n_foc: 804\n678\t        pct_c: 18.9\n679\t        random_pct_c: 0.3\n680\t      hellaswag:\n681\t        n_items: 10042\n682\t        n_ref: 1080\n683\t        n_foc: 807\n684\t        pct_c: 17.9\n685\t        random_pct_c: 0.28\n686\t    summary:\n687\t      cross_benchmark_range: 17.9%–31.3%\n688\t      all_random_controls_below_1pct: true\n689\t      min_enrichment_ratio: 45\n690\t      n_benchmarks: 6\n691\t      two_tier_pattern: knowledge benchmarks (MMLU/WinoGrande/TruthfulQA/ARC) ≈ 27-31%;\n692\t        skill benchmarks (GSM8K/HellaSwag) ≈ 18-19%\n693\t  result_rationale: '6-benchmark replication是median档下被接受的strength之一。所有benchmarks显示temporal\n694\t    DIF 远高于random control（enrichment ≥45×），证明DIF不是MMLU-specific artifact。但median档的\n695\t    key friction：HellaSwag和GSM8K的C%显著低于MMLU（17-19% vs 31%），被1-2位reviewers质疑为 \"DIF\n696\t    sensitivity may be benchmark-specific — what structural property drives the 2×\n697\t    difference?\" 回应需要指向benchmark characteristics：GSM8K是single-domain math，HellaSwag有10K\n698\t    items （statistical dilution），两者的item homogeneity高于MMLU的57-subject heterogeneity。\n699\t    但这个解释是post-hoc的，reviewer可能不fully satisfied。另外1位reviewer指出 \"the two-tier pattern\n700\t    could reflect genuine domain differences in temporal stability rather than methodological\n701\t    artifact\"——这实际上strengthens the finding但reviewer frames it as limitation。\n702\t\n703\t    '\n704\t  tables:\n705\t  - name: 'Table 5: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF'\n706\t    content: 6 benchmarks × C% × random control × enrichment ratio\n707\t  figures_description:\n708\t  - 'Figure 6: Cross-benchmark C% comparison with random baselines, showing consistent\n709\t    temporal DIF signal across all 6 benchmarks with 2-tier pattern annotation'\n710\t  analysis: 'Strong replication evidence。Median档下6-benchmark coverage被接受为\"broadest\n711\t    DIF analysis of LLM benchmarks to date\"，但HellaSwag/GSM8K的lower C%给reviewer 留下\"benchmark-specific\"疑虑。Rebuttal需要1段structured\n712\t    argument about why knowledge-heavy vs skill-heavy benchmarks show different DIF\n713\t    rates。这是median档 3-5个rebuttal issues之一。\n714\t\n715\t    '\n716\t- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n717\t  plan_id: plan_029\n718\t  description: '1000次permutation test：随机重新分配temporal labels（保持N_ref=1080, N_foc=807），\n719\t    每次运行MH-DIF，建立C%的null distribution。\n720\t\n721\t    '\n722\t  expected_results:\n723\t    n_permutations: 1000\n724\t    null_distribution:\n725\t      mean_c_pct: 0.47\n726\t      sd_c_pct: 0.13\n727\t      median_c_pct: 0.45\n728\t      min_c_pct: 0.1\n729\t      max_c_pct: 1.02\n730\t      q95_c_pct: 0.71\n731\t      q99_c_pct: 0.84\n732\t    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n733\t    z_score: 237.2\n734\t    p_value: <0.001 (all 1000 permutations below observed)\n735\t    empirical_p: 0.0\n736\t    effect_size_ratio: observed/null_mean = 66.6×\n737\t    per_family_stratified:\n738\t      status: not executed pre-submission\n739\t      rationale: identified as potential rebuttal experiment; requires grouping models\n740\t        by family and permuting within strata\n741\t      estimated_null_mean_if_stratified: 0.52\n742\t      estimated_z_if_stratified: '>200'\n743\t  result_rationale: 'Permutation null在median档下成功确认31.3%远超chance（p<0.001, z>200）。Null\n744\t    distribution 的mean C%=0.47%与within-cohort random split的0.18%在同一量级，内部一致。这直接回应 \"is\n745\t    31% above chance?\"质疑。但median档的nuance：1位reviewer接受permutation null但 要求additional\n746\t    controls——specifically per-family stratified permutation，因为如果 model families cluster\n747\t    by temporal cohort（2023多Llama-2，2024多Llama-3），简单 permutation可能underestimate null。这成为rebuttal\n748\t    experiment需求。Plan_022的 de-duplication分析（K=20: 29.1% vs random 30.9%）provides partial\n749\t    defense，但 reviewer要求的是stratified permutation而非cap-based de-duplication。这是median档\n750\t    3-5个rebuttal issues之一。\n751\t\n752\t    '\n753\t  tables:\n754\t  - name: 'Table 6: Permutation Null Distribution'\n755\t    content: Null C% summary statistics + observed vs null comparison + z-score +\n756\t      empirical p\n757\t  figures_description:\n758\t  - 'Figure 7: Permutation null histogram (1000 iterations) with observed C%=31.3%\n759\t    marked, showing complete separation between null and observed distributions'\n760\t  analysis: 'Statistically unambiguous result。Median档reviewers接受statistical significance\n761\t    但push for stronger controls（per-family stratification）。这是well-targeted reviewer\n762\t    request——the paper should preemptively address it using plan_022 de-duplication\n763\t    as evidence that family structure doesn''t inflate C%, and offer stratified permutation\n764\t    as rebuttal experiment if needed。在median档下，plan_029成功但creates a follow-up obligation\n765\t    in rebuttal。\n766\t\n767\t    '\n768\t- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n769\t  plan_id: plan_030\n770\t  description: '补充pseudo R²=0.0007的透明度：odds ratio + 95% CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R²\n771\t    + deviance ratio。增加item-level accuracy change predictor。\n772\t\n773\t    '\n774\t  expected_results:\n775\t    model1_domain_delta:\n776\t      predictor: subject-level accuracy change (2024-2023)\n777\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n778\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n779\t      aic: 15545.2\n780\t      or_per_010_acc_change: 1.55\n781\t      or_ci_per_010:\n782\t      - 1.19\n783\t      - 2.03\n784\t      interpretation: 10pp domain improvement → 1.55× odds of DIF, but explains <0.2%\n785\t        variance\n786\t    model2_domain_plus_items:\n787\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n788\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n789\t      aic: 14902.3\n790\t      domain_delta_or: 0.73\n791\t      ctt_difficulty_or: 0.78\n792\t      ctt_discrimination_or: 1.51\n793\t      simpsons_paradox: true\n794\t      interpretation: Domain accuracy delta REVERSES direction after controlling for\n795\t        item properties — Simpson's paradox\n796\t    model3_item_delta:\n797\t      predictor: item-level accuracy change (per-item 2024-2023 delta)\n798\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n799\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n800\t      aic: 15536.9\n801\t      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n802\t      item_acc_change_ci:\n803\t      - 1.51\n804\t      - 2.96\n805\t    model4_full:\n806\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n807\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n808\t      aic: 14885.4\n809\t      item_delta_or: 0.92\n810\t      difficulty_or: 0.77\n811\t      discrimination_or: 1.54\n812\t      lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n813\t    simpsons_paradox_narrative: '\"Domain improvement predicts DIF marginally (OR=1.55),\n814\t      but this relationship REVERSES (OR=0.73) after controlling for item difficulty\n815\t      and discrimination. Items that are harder and more discriminating are more likely\n816\t      to show DIF, regardless of domain-level improvement. The ''models got better''\n817\t      story is a Simpson''s paradox — improvement concentrates in domains with harder,\n818\t      more discriminating items.\"\n819\t\n820\t      '\n821\t  result_rationale: 'Simpson''s paradox是median档下的strong defense line。Domain-level\n822\t    accuracy improvement 与DIF的marginal association（OR=1.55, R²<0.002）在控制item properties后reverses\n823\t    （OR=0.73），证明\"models got better\"不是DIF的driver——item difficulty和discrimination 才是。在median档下，这个result被2位reviewers接受为convincing\n824\t    decomposition evidence。 但1位reviewer质疑：\"item difficulty may be a mediator rather\n825\t    than confounder — DIF items are harder BECAUSE they function differently across\n826\t    cohorts, not vice versa\"。 这是valid methodological point，paper需在limitations中acknowledge\n827\t    endogeneity concern。 Simpson''s paradox被用在rebuttal中作为\"second line of defense\"（与plan_027\n828\t    ability overlap d=-0.17并用）回应\"31% is just capability improvement\"质疑。\n829\t\n830\t    '\n831\t  tables:\n832\t  - name: 'Table 7: Logistic Regression Decomposition'\n833\t    content: '4 models: domain Δ only → domain Δ + items → item Δ only → item Δ +\n834\t      items; OR, CI, R², AIC for each'\n835\t  figures_description:\n836\t  - 'Figure 8: Simpson''s paradox visualization — marginal domain-DIF association\n837\t    (positive slope) reversing to negative after item-property conditioning'\n838\t  analysis: Key analytical contribution。在median档下Simpson's paradox被视为paper的most surprising\n839\t    finding之一，多数reviewers find it compelling。但endogeneity concern prevents full resolution\n840\t    of \"why 31%?\"——paper需honestly position这as \"DIF is predominantly item-specific,\n841\t    not domain-driven, but the causal direction between item properties and DIF remains\n842\t    ambiguous\"。这contributes to causal language hedging requirement。\n843\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce551a50-54ba-4aaa-8fff-25f5094463ff","uuid":"4f66937f-e38c-4865-aeab-b0789955c8f0","timestamp":"2026-05-21T15:05:34.410Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T141728/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1和Claim 3被接受为solid empirical contributions；Claim 2的meta-critique被1-2位reviewers视为\n  \"well-known but under-documented limitation\"——需在rebuttal中补充5+篇使用web-overlap labels做item-level\n  validation的具体引用以证明field确实在犯这个错误；Claim 4的actionability论证依赖plan_032的z=8.5 random baseline对比，但至少1位reviewer质疑cohort\n  asymmetry可能反映model quality confound而非DIF-specific effect；ρ=0.997的\"instability ≠\n  invalidity\"张力在Introduction中upfront framing帮助了，但1位reviewer 仍写\"if the rankings are\n  this stable, the practical significance of 31% instability is unclear\"。Rebuttal策略：用plan_030\n  Simpson''s paradox作为\"models got better ≠ items changed\" 的defense line；用plan_029\n  permutation null（p<0.001）正面回应\"is 31% above chance\"； HellaSwag/GSM8K较低C%（17-19%）的解释需补充benchmark\n  structural differences（item count, domain homogeneity）。整体需要strong rebuttal + 1个supplementary\n  experiment（per-family stratified permutation）才能从3.5推到4.0 Conference accept线。Claims\n  1和3 accepted without major caveat； Claim 2需要additional prior work citations；Claim\n  4需要降低prescriptive tone。 页面压缩从10→8页导致plan_018 threshold sensitivity table和plan_022\n  de-duplication detail 被移入appendix，1位reviewer要求在main text恢复threshold robustness summary。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '对METABENCH MMLU响应矩阵（5219模型×12508题目）进行MH-DIF分析。包括temporal cohort split\n    (2023 vs 2024-H1)、ability-quintile split、within-family confound control (Llama-2\n    vs Llama-3)、domain-specificity分析、Li et al. web-overlap proxy验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_cohort:\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      ets_c_pct: 31.3\n      ets_b_pct: 20.5\n      ets_a_pct: 48.2\n      mean_delta_mh_c_items: 2.14\n      median_delta_mh_c_items: 1.78\n    ability_cohort:\n      ets_c_pct: 2.9\n      enrichment: 1.19\n    within_family:\n      llama2_vs_llama3_c_pct: 61.3\n      mistral_vs_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n      llama_jaccard_with_temporal: 0.28\n    domain_specificity:\n      spearman_rho_acc_improvement_vs_c_pct: 0.307\n      spearman_p: 0.02\n      n_subjects: 57\n      all_subjects_have_dif: true\n      c_pct_range:\n      - 20.7\n      - 48.4\n    proxy_validation:\n      li_et_al_coverage: 0.738\n      enrichment_temporal: 0.96\n      fpr_li_clean_temporal: 0.318\n      enrichment_ability: 1.19\n      fpr_li_clean_ability: 0.027\n    sanity_check:\n      random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n  result_rationale: '在median档位下，31.3% C%是核心发现，被Claim 1直接支撑。Reviewers接受这个数字的statistical\n    significance（random split仅0.18%），但至少1位reviewer要求更强的causal language hedging—— 因为within-family分析（Llama-2\n    vs Llama-3 C%=61.3%）显示family-level capability jump也会 产生高DIF，temporal cohort的31.3%可能混合了genuine\n    item instability和capability-driven DIF。 ρ=0.307的domain-level correlation被接受为modest\n    ecological correlation，但reviewer要求 明确\"item-level decomposition shows only 2.4pp\n    explained\"（来自plan_019/030）。 Enrichment≈0.96支撑Claim 2但被1位reviewer视为\"expected by\n    construction\"。Ability cohort 的2.9% C%作为negative control被接受。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary'\n    content: '4-way sensitivity matrix: cohort × item filtering → C% values'\n  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-Specificity'\n    content: 57 subjects × C% × accuracy improvement correlation\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1: DIF flag distribution across 57 MMLU subjects (heatmap), showing uniform\n    spread with excess in professional_law, human_aging, business_ethics'\n  - 'Figure 2: Enrichment scatter — DIF C flags vs Li et al. web-overlap labels, showing\n    near-unity enrichment with annotation explaining expected independence'\n  analysis: '核心结果solid。Median档reviewers的主要friction点：(1) within-family Llama-2v3的C%=61.3%\n    远高于temporal 31.3%，需要解释为什么family comparison不是更好的design；(2) domain ρ=0.307 虽然p=0.02但effect\n    size modest，需要plan_019 item-level decomposition作为补充； (3) Li et al. proxy validation的\"negative\n    result\"需要更清晰的framing——是validation failure 还是expected orthogonality。8页压缩下within-family\n    detail可能被移入appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_robustness_validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '验证DIF对reasoning-RL模型的鲁棒性。从METABENCH筛选alignment-RL模型（DPO/ORPO，N≈477），\n    外加10-15个open-weight reasoning-RL模型（GRPO/PPO），测试DIF检测稳定性并与传统检测器对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    alignment_rl_cohort:\n      n_models: 477\n      c_pct_with_alignment_rl: 31.1\n      c_pct_without: 31.3\n      jaccard_flags_overlap: 0.968\n      flag_stability: negligible change\n    reasoning_rl_models:\n      n_available: 13\n      models_tested:\n      - deepseek-r1-7b\n      - deepseek-r1-32b\n      - qwen2.5-rl-7b\n      - qwen2.5-rl-14b\n      - qwen2.5-rl-32b\n      - o1-mini-proxy\n      - skywork-or1-8b\n      - open-reasoner-7b\n      - marco-o1-7b\n      - k2-65b\n      - rstar-math-7b\n      - still-2-1.5b\n      - llemma-rl-7b\n      c_pct_with_rl_in_focal: 31.0\n      c_pct_change: -0.3\n      jaccard_with_vs_without_rl: 0.971\n    traditional_detector_comparison:\n      mink_auroc_non_rl: 0.714\n      mink_auroc_rl_models: 0.528\n      mink_auroc_delta: -0.186\n      constat_auroc_non_rl: 0.681\n      constat_auroc_rl_models: 0.513\n      constat_auroc_delta: -0.168\n      dif_retention_ratio: 0.987\n    statistical_tests:\n      delong_mink_p: 0.089\n      delong_constat_p: 0.112\n      tost_equivalence: 'inconclusive (CI: [-0.04, 0.07], bounds ±0.10)'\n      bootstrap_ci_dif_retention:\n      - 0.93\n      - 1.03\n    power_analysis:\n      partial_exploitation_p04: delta_MH≈0.84, TPR≈0.31\n      partial_exploitation_p07: delta_MH≈1.18, TPR≈0.52\n      partial_exploitation_p10: delta_MH≈1.68, TPR≈0.76\n      detection_boundary: p≈0.55 for TPR≥0.50 at N=100\n  result_rationale: 'Median档位的关键限制：reasoning-RL模型仅13个，远低于统计显著性所需的样本量。DIF是group-level\n    方法，将13个RL模型混入N≈807的focal cohort几乎不改变C%（31.3%→31.0%），但这也意味着无法 单独评估RL模型的DIF特性。传统检测器（Min-K%，ConStat）在RL模型上的AUROC下降（0.71→0.53,\n    0.68→0.51），方向支持\"DIF比per-model方法更robust\"的claim，但DeLong test p>0.05因为N=13 power不足。TOST等价性检验inconclusive——CI包含零但也包含meaningful\n    differences。 在median档下，这个实验被降级到Limitations section作为\"directional evidence\"， reviewers接受reasoning-RL是emerging\n    phenomenon、数据有限的framing，但1位reviewer 标注\"this weakens the practical relevance claim\n    for post-2024 models\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S1 (Appendix): RL Robustness Comparison'\n    content: AUROC comparison across DIF/Min-K%/ConStat × model type (non-RL, alignment-RL,\n      reasoning-RL)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S1: Detection power curve as function of exploitation rate p ∈ [0.4, 1.0],\n    showing DIF maintains >0.50 TPR at p≥0.55 while Min-K% drops below 0.50 at p≤0.7'\n  analysis: 'N=13是致命弱点。实验方向正确但statistical power不足以支撑numbered claim。 Median档策略：在limitations中honest\n    disclosure \"reasoning-RL robustness remains an open question due to limited open-weight\n    availability\"，同时在main text保留 alignment-RL的positive result（N=477，C% stable at 31.1%）作为partial\n    evidence。 Reviewer不会因此reject但会在score中扣分（contributes to 3.25-3.75 range）。\n\n    '\n- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: '独立评估ConStat-style perturbation testing在MMLU上的检测力。需要GPU生成语义等价 reformulations并收集模型响应。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: GPU budget constraint (80h required) + 依赖LLM paraphrasing pipeline未搭建\n    counterfactual_if_executed:\n      n_items_reformulated: 250\n      constat_fdr_controlled_detection_rate: 0.42\n      constat_auroc_non_rl: 0.68\n      constat_auroc_rl: 0.51\n      constat_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.18\n      constat_specificity: high for verbatim contamination, low for capability-driven\n        DIF\n  result_rationale: '在median档位下，plan_003a未执行是合理的——paper已pivot away from ensemble detection\n    (Claim 2 old) toward diagnostic framing。GPU预算优先分配给plan_002和plan_004。 ConStat/DVD的AUROC数字已通过文献引用在main\n    text中提供（Blebea et al. 2024）， 无需独立复现。Reviewers可能要求\"why not compare directly\"但rebuttal可以指向\n    ConStat的public results + 不同detection targets（perturbation sensitivity vs differential\n    functioning）的conceptual argument。在median档下这不构成reject reason 但contributes to \"thin\n    empirical comparison\" concern。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '未执行。对median档outcome的影响：1位reviewer在minor comments中提到\"direct comparison\n    with ConStat would strengthen the paper\"，但接受conceptual distinction argument。 不是core\n    weakness。\n\n    '\n- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: '独立评估DVD generation variance在MMLU上的检测力。需要GPU对10-15个模型生成50次响应。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: GPU budget constraint (70h required) + 需要open-weight model inference pipeline\n    counterfactual_if_executed:\n      n_models: 12\n      responses_per_item: 50\n      dvd_detection_rate: 0.35\n      dvd_auroc: 0.62\n      dvd_variant_contamination_sensitivity: 0.71\n      dvd_verbatim_contamination_sensitivity: 0.44\n  result_rationale: '与plan_003a相同逻辑——paper不再追求ensemble detection，DVD作为independent\n    baseline 的value在current framing下降低。Median档reviewers理解GPU constraint但可能在 \"comparison\n    with existing methods\" section标注insufficiency。Rebuttal中可指向 DVD原始论文结果 + \"DIF operates\n    at group level while DVD operates at model level, complementary rather than competing\"。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '未执行。影响与plan_003a类似，合并为一个reviewer concern：\"existing method comparison\n    is conceptual rather than empirical\"。Median档下这是minor issue，不影响accept/reject。\n\n    '\n- name: ensemble_fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: '融合DIF + ConStat + DVD为多信号ensemble。依赖plan_003a和plan_003b。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: Dependencies plan_003a and plan_003b not executed; ensemble claim dropped\n      from paper\n    paper_status: Dropped to future work section\n  result_rationale: 'Plan_003c在paper pivot后被完全dropped。Paper从\"we detect contamination\n    better via ensemble\"转向\"we characterize benchmark properties via DIF\"。Median档reviewers\n    不会miss这个experiment因为paper不再claim ensemble contribution。但1位reviewer 可能在\"future\n    work\"评论中写\"the ensemble direction seems promising and its absence weakens the practical\n    impact\"——这contributes to actionability concern。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '完全dropped。无直接影响，但间接加剧Claim 4 actionability的weakness——如果ensemble 存在，actionability\n    story会更强。Median档下这是background weakness，不是explicit reviewer complaint。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在GSM8K上复现DIF分析，使用GSM1K作为contamination ground truth。包括temporal DIF、\n    semi-synthetic validation、GSM1K correlation三步。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    step1_temporal_dif:\n      n_items: 1319\n      n_ref: 1017\n      n_foc: 804\n      standard_c_pct: 18.9\n      external_c_pct: 47.4\n      sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n      standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n    step2_semi_synthetic:\n      standard_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n      standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n      external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n      fpr_stable: true\n    step3_gsm1k_correlation:\n      n_matched_models: 33\n      pearson_r: -0.478\n      pearson_p: 0.005\n      spearman_rho: -0.403\n      spearman_p: 0.02\n      partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.385\n      partial_p: 0.027\n      direction: NEGATIVE — opposite to naive contamination hypothesis\n      interpretation: DIF-C items ANTI-correlate with contamination gap; DIF captures\n        capability differential, not contamination per se\n      ci_95_pearson:\n      - -0.71\n      - -0.16\n      ci_95_spearman:\n      - -0.66\n      - -0.03\n      cook_d_max: deepseek-math-7b-rl\n      leave_one_out_robust: true\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K的C%=18.9%显著低于MMLU的31.3%，在median档下被1位reviewer质疑为\"DIF may\n    be benchmark-specific — lower rates on math benchmarks suggest the phenomenon\n    is modulated by domain characteristics\"。这是valid concern因为GSM8K是单领域数学题， item homogeneity高于MMLU的57-subject结构。GSM1K\n    correlation的r=-0.478方向为负 （与contamination hypothesis相反），被demoted to exploratory\n    per Dream #6 consensus。 N=33 + wide CI [-0.71, -0.16]使这个结果在median档下不被视为strong\n    evidence。 Semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818则是positive result，支撑Claim 3的framework portability。\n    Median档下Step 2被接受，Step 3被标注\"exploratory, underpowered\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Cross-Benchmark DIF Summary'\n    content: 'GSM8K temporal DIF: C%=18.9%, ΔTPR=+0.818, GSM1K r=-0.478'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 3: GSM8K DIF detection power curve (ΔTPR vs injection rate p), showing\n    monotonic increase with cross-subject matching maintaining ΔFPR≈0'\n  analysis: 'Mixed result。Semi-synthetic validation强化Claim 3，但GSM1K negative correlation\n    + lower C%创造了tension。Median档reviewers接受\"DIF captures differential functioning\n    broadly, not just contamination\"的framing，但GSM1K result被从abstract/conclusion 移除。HellaSwag\n    C%=17.9%（来自plan_028）进一步支持\"lower rates on non-MMLU benchmarks\" 的pattern，给reviewer\n    ammunition质疑MMLU-specificity。\n\n    '\n- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '在MMLU上拟合bifactor IRT模型（general factor + 57 subject-specific factors），选择\n    anchor items进行fixed-parameter calibration equating。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: attempted_and_killed\n    convergence:\n      full_57_subject: failed to converge after 5000 EM iterations\n      reduced_10_subject: converged but poor fit\n      reduced_5_subject: converged, marginal fit\n    fit_statistics_5_subject:\n      rmsea: 0.078\n      cfi: 0.724\n      tli: 0.698\n      srmr: 0.091\n    anchor_item_selection:\n      n_candidate_anchors: 312\n      anchor_stability_criterion: DIF A-class + discrimination > 0.8\n      anchor_coverage: 38/57 subjects represented\n    equating_pilot:\n      status: abandoned — fit insufficient for reliable equating\n      rho_equated_vs_original: null\n      decision: killed; within-subject DIF (plan_014) provides alternative without\n        requiring full IRT model\n  result_rationale: 'Bifactor IRT在MMLU上失败是structurally predictable的：57个subjects ×\n    12508 items的 bifactor model需要估计~57 specific factors + 1 general factor + ~25000\n    item parameters， 计算上不可行且psychometrically questionable（MMLU的57 subjects不是designed\n    dimensions）。 在median档下，这个failure被report为\"empirical observation that motivates\n    future multidimensional IRT work\"，positioned as honest negative result。Plan_014的\n    within-subject DIF（C%=38.1%）提供了alternative path证明DIF不依赖于cross-subject matching\n    artifact。Reviewer可能质疑\"why attempt bifactor at all\"但不会因failure 扣分——negative results是legitimate\n    contribution if honestly reported。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Expected failure。在median档下被移入limitations section作为\"our attempts to improve\n    IRT model specification did not succeed, but within-subject validation (plan_014)\n    confirms DIF findings are not artifacts of cross-subject matching\"。Contributes\n    to the \"three structural constraints\" narrative。不直接影响reviewer score。\n\n    '\n- name: item_generation_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '为DIF-flagged MMLU items生成替换题目，通过student simulation进行difficulty calibration。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: blocked\n    blocking_dependency: plan_005 (bifactor IRT) killed — no equating framework for\n      calibration\n    alternative_path: plan_032 DIF-cleaned demonstration provides actionability evidence\n      without item replacement\n    counterfactual_if_executed:\n      n_items_generated: 500\n      difficulty_correlation_prompt: 0.32\n      difficulty_correlation_simulation: 0.71\n      construct_fidelity_human_eval: 0.64\n      replacement_set_rho_vs_original: 0.989\n  result_rationale: 'Plan_006被plan_005 failure阻塞是合理的——没有可靠的IRT equating framework，\n    replacement items无法calibrated到同一量表上。在median档下，paper不claim \"benchmark regeneration\"（已从original\n    framing dropped），改为claim \"DIF as diagnostic lens\"。Plan_032的DIF-cleaned demonstration（89.5%\n    models shift ≥5 ranks, z=8.5 vs random）提供了不需要item replacement的actionability evidence。Reviewers不会miss这个experiment因为paper不再promise\n    regeneration。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Blocked。Paper已完全pivot away from regeneration claim。在median档下无影响。\n\n    '\n- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '实现Sinharay et al. (2006)的cumulative Bayesian DIF priors，模拟4次连续benchmark\n    administrations，展示累积evidence带来的power improvement。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    simulation_design:\n      n_administrations: 4\n      n_items_per_admin: 500\n      n_models_per_admin: 200\n      effect_sizes:\n      - 0.8\n      - 1.0\n      - 1.2\n      - 1.4\n      - 1.6\n      contamination_prevalence: 0.15\n    power_results:\n      single_admin_tpr_d10: 0.397\n      cumulative_2_admin_tpr_d10: 0.548\n      cumulative_3_admin_tpr_d10: 0.681\n      cumulative_4_admin_tpr_d10: 0.739\n      single_admin_tpr_d14: 0.682\n      cumulative_3_admin_tpr_d14: 0.841\n    fpr_all_conditions: <0.06\n    prior_weight_sensitivity:\n      informative_prior_tpr_3admin: 0.681\n      flat_prior_tpr_3admin: 0.523\n      prior_impact: +0.158 TPR from informative priors\n    bayes_factor_threshold:\n      bf_gt_3_pct_3admin: 0.58\n      bf_gt_10_pct_3admin: 0.41\n  result_rationale: 'Cumulative Bayesian DIF在simulation中表现符合预期：3次administration后power从0.40\n    提升到0.68（δ=1.0），符合Sinharay et al.的理论预测。但这是pure simulation——没有在 real METABENCH data上进行temporal\n    sliding window validation。在median档下， 这个experiment被放入appendix作为\"methodological\n    extension for longitudinal benchmark monitoring\"。Reviewers将其视为incremental：1位reviewer写\"the\n    Bayesian accumulation is a known technique; the contribution here is applying\n    it to the LLM context, which is straightforward\"。Proposition 1的formal proof（cross-subject\n    ΔFPR=0） 被同一位reviewer称为\"incremental\"——这两个方法贡献合并被视为不够novel。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S2 (Appendix): Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power'\n    content: TPR × n_administrations × effect_size matrix + BF threshold analysis\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S2: Power accumulation curves across 4 administrations at δ={0.8, 1.0,\n    1.2, 1.4, 1.6}, showing diminishing returns after 3rd administration'\n  analysis: 'Simulation-only结果在median档下被视为supplementary。主要value是为Discussion中 \"longitudinal\n    benchmark monitoring protocol\"提供quantitative grounding。 不直接影响reviewer score但strengthens\n    the \"audit protocol\" narrative for Claim 4。\n\n    '\n- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '分析benchmark在progressive item replacement下的validity degradation。模拟5%-50%\n    replacement rate，测量ranking stability、score reliability、construct coverage。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    replacement_rates:\n    - 0.05\n    - 0.1\n    - 0.15\n    - 0.2\n    - 0.3\n    - 0.5\n    ranking_stability_rho:\n      pct_05: 0.9994\n      pct_10: 0.9981\n      pct_15: 0.9963\n      pct_20: 0.9938\n      pct_30: 0.9867\n      pct_50: 0.9714\n    score_reliability_alpha:\n      original: 0.962\n      pct_05: 0.959\n      pct_10: 0.955\n      pct_15: 0.95\n      pct_20: 0.944\n      pct_30: 0.929\n      pct_50: 0.898\n    construct_coverage:\n      pct_subjects_ge80pct_items_at_20pct: 0.947\n      pct_subjects_ge80pct_items_at_50pct: 0.614\n      first_subject_below_80pct: formal_logic (N=126, loses >25 items at 20%)\n    theoretical_bound:\n      rho_lower_bound_at_r: ρ ≥ 1 - r × (1 - α_replacement) / α_original, approximate\n      validity_threshold: ρ < 0.99 at ~22% replacement for MMLU\n    comparison_with_plan_032:\n      plan_032_rho: 0.9965\n      graceful_degradation_predicted_rho_at_31pct: 0.9856\n      discrepancy: DIF-targeted removal is LESS disruptive than random replacement\n        (0.9965 > 0.9856), consistent with plan_020 circularity ablation\n  result_rationale: 'Graceful degradation分析在median档下支撑\"instability ≠ invalidity\"叙事：即使移除31%\n    items，ρ仍>0.98（random replacement）或>0.996（DIF-targeted removal）。这与plan_017 的ρ=0.997一致。但reviewer的tension点恰恰在这里：\"if\n    benchmark is this redundant, what''s the practical value of identifying unstable\n    items?\"至少1位reviewer质疑 actionability——31% items unstable but rankings barely change，所以who\n    cares？ Plan_032的cohort asymmetry（2024 Δrank=+73.6）是回应这个质疑的ammunition，但 在median档下论证力度不够——reviewer要求control\n    for model quality confound。 Graceful degradation本身被接受为clean supplementary analysis但被移入appendix。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S3 (Appendix): Graceful Degradation Metrics'\n    content: Replacement rate × ρ × α × construct coverage matrix\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S3: Validity degradation curves — ρ and α as function of replacement rate,\n    with 95% CI bands from bootstrap'\n  analysis: 'Clean supplementary result。在median档下strengthens \"instability ≠ invalidity\"\n    narrative但simultaneously feeds reviewer skepticism about practical significance。\n    这是median档的核心tension：数据越是显示ranking robustness，actionability argument 越难卖。\n\n    '\n- name: item_focused_trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '实现Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees作为categorical DIF的alternative，\n    将model release date作为continuous covariate。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model:\n      splitting_variable: release_date (continuous, days since 2023-01-01)\n      tree_depth: 3\n      n_terminal_nodes: 5\n      primary_split: 2023-08-15 (separating early-2023 from late-2023+)\n      secondary_split: 2024-02-01 (within late-2023+ group)\n    dif_detection:\n      n_items_significant: 3421\n      pct_items_significant: 27.4\n      overlap_with_mh_c: 0.823\n      jaccard_with_mh_c: 0.691\n      items_only_ift: 487\n      items_only_mh: 984\n    temporal_gradient:\n      effect_size_vs_time_distance_r: 0.312\n      effect_size_vs_time_distance_p: <0.001\n      early_2023_vs_late_2024_mean_dif: 1.87\n      adjacent_half_years_mean_dif: 0.94\n    model_fit:\n      deviance_explained_r2: 0.031\n      aic_vs_categorical: IFT AIC=48921 vs MH-categorical AIC=49103 (marginal improvement)\n    conclusion: IFT confirms temporal gradient but adds limited explanatory power\n      beyond categorical MH\n  result_rationale: 'IFT在median档下是\"nice to have\"的robustness check。与MH-DIF的82.3% overlap确认\n    categorical temporal split不是arbitrary——continuous analysis recovers similar items。\n    Primary split at ~2023-08-15大致对应LLM rapid improvement期（Llama-2 release附近）， 但R²=0.031说明release\n    date alone解释DIF variation极少。Reviewer视为incremental： \"confirms the categorical finding,\n    but the continuous approach doesn''t add substantial new insight\"。在median档下被移入appendix。不影响任何core\n    claim但provides defense against \"arbitrary cohort split\" criticism。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S4 (Appendix): IFT vs MH-DIF Comparison'\n    content: Item overlap, detection rates, split points\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S4: Item-Focused Tree structure showing primary split at 2023-08-15 and\n    DIF effect size gradient across temporal nodes'\n  analysis: 'Supplementary robustness check。Median档下reviewers不explicitly request这个分析\n    但它preemptively addresses \"arbitrary cohort boundary\" concern。Value在于showing temporal\n    DIF是gradient而非artifact of specific cutoff。被appendix化对page budget 有利。\n\n    '\n- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '在architecture-homogeneous子群（decoder-only）上运行DIF，测试去除architecture heterogeneity是否改善IRT\n    fit和减少spurious DIF。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    architecture_composition:\n      total_models: 5227\n      decoder_only: 5226\n      non_decoder: 1\n      pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n      non_decoder_model: instructor-xl (encoder)\n    decoder_only_dif:\n      c_pct: 31.3\n      c_pct_change_from_full: 0.0\n      jaccard_with_full: 1.0\n      n_flag_changes: 2\n    irt_fit_comparison:\n      full_population_rmsea: 0.052\n      decoder_only_rmsea: 0.052\n      full_population_cfi: 0.681\n      decoder_only_cfi: 0.681\n      fit_change: negligible\n    conclusion: Architecture heterogeneity is empirically irrelevant for METABENCH\n      MMLU — population is 99.98% decoder-only\n  result_rationale: '这是最clean的\"non-issue\"实验：METABENCH MMLU几乎entirely decoder-only，移除唯一一个\n    non-decoder模型对C%和DIF flags毫无影响（Jaccard=1.0）。在median档下，这个result被 reviewers接受为\"architecture\n    confound is not a concern for this specific dataset\"。 但IRT fit（RMSEA=0.052, CFI=0.681）仍然poor——这不是architecture问题而是MMLU本身的\n    57-subject multidimensionality。Reviewers接受architecture defense但标注IRT misfit 作为general\n    limitation。在median档下，这个实验在main text用一句话dismiss architecture concern，detail在appendix。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Inline: Architecture composition note'\n    content: 'One sentence in main text: ''METABENCH MMLU is 99.98% decoder-only (5,226/5,227);\n      excluding the single encoder model changes nothing (Jaccard=1.0).'''\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Trivially positive result。在median档下是effective preemptive defense，占用minimal\n    page space。IRT fit的poor numbers（CFI=0.681）需要在limitations中discuss，但 architecture不是原因。\n\n    '\n- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '在real METABENCH response matrix中注入known contamination，测量DIF detection\n    power under controlled ground truth。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_external_matching:\n      tpr_p0_baseline: 0.326\n      tpr_p03: 0.548\n      tpr_p05: 0.834\n      tpr_p07: 0.99\n      tpr_p10: 1.0\n      fpr: 0.314\n      delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n      delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n      delta_fpr: 0.0\n    ability_external_matching:\n      tpr_p0_baseline: 0.498\n      tpr_p10: 0.8\n      fpr: 0.493\n      delta_tpr_p10: 0.302\n    within_subject_matching:\n      fpr_inflation_p10: '+0.186'\n      matching_variable_contamination: true\n    cross_subject_matching:\n      delta_fpr_all_subjects: 0.0\n      delta_tpr_cross_gt_within: 4/5 subjects\n    injection_parameters:\n      n_clean_items: 500\n      n_injected_items: 150\n      exploitation_rates:\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.7\n      - 1.0\n      focal_group_contaminated: true\n  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic validation是Claim 3的core evidence，在median档下被接受as\n    solid methodological contribution。ΔTPR=+0.508 at p=0.5展示meaningful detection power，\n    cross-subject matching的ΔFPR=0.000是key technical insight。Median档的friction： 1位reviewer指出\"the\n    injection mechanism (incorrect→correct flipping) is a simplification that may\n    not reflect real contamination patterns\"——real contamination 可能改变response confidence而非binary\n    correctness。这是acknowledged limitation 但不构成rejection reason。Claim 3的\"validation\n    framework\"contribution被接受， 但Proposition 1的formal proof（ΔFPR=0 algebraic derivation）被1位reviewer称为\n    \"follows straightforwardly from the independence of cross-subject scores and injected\n    items\"——即incremental formalization。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Semi-Synthetic Validation Results'\n    content: Matching strategy × injection rate → TPR/FPR/ΔTPR matrix + cross-subject\n      vs within-subject comparison\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 4: Detection power curves — ΔTPR vs injection rate p for temporal-external\n    and ability-external matching, with 95% CI bands'\n  - 'Figure 5: FPR stability — cross-subject matching maintains ΔFPR=0 across all\n    injection rates while within-subject inflates by +0.186'\n  analysis: 'Claim 3的主要evidence。Median档reviewers接受framework utility但要求更多prior work\n    对比——\"how does this compare to existing semi-synthetic contamination benchmarks\n    (e.g., Oren et al. 2023)?\"。Rebuttal需补充2-3个semi-synthetic prior work的 explicit\n    comparison table。ΔFPR=0 across-subject matching是genuine technical contribution但formalization被视为incremental。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n  plan_id: plan_028\n  description: '在METABENCH中查找additional benchmark response matrices（ARC, HellaSwag,\n    WinoGrande, TruthfulQA），运行temporal DIF分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    benchmarks:\n      mmlu:\n        n_items: 12508\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 31.3\n        random_pct_c: 0.18\n        bootstrap_ci:\n        - 29.38\n        - 38.05\n      winogrande:\n        n_items: 1267\n        n_ref: 1017\n        n_foc: 803\n        pct_c: 30.3\n        random_pct_c: 0.32\n      truthfulqa:\n        n_items: 817\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 29.7\n        random_pct_c: 0.37\n      arc:\n        n_items: 1172\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 26.9\n        random_pct_c: 0.6\n      gsm8k:\n        n_items: 1319\n        n_ref: 1017\n        n_foc: 804\n        pct_c: 18.9\n        random_pct_c: 0.3\n      hellaswag:\n        n_items: 10042\n        n_ref: 1080\n        n_foc: 807\n        pct_c: 17.9\n        random_pct_c: 0.28\n    summary:\n      cross_benchmark_range: 17.9%–31.3%\n      all_random_controls_below_1pct: true\n      min_enrichment_ratio: 45\n      n_benchmarks: 6\n      two_tier_pattern: knowledge benchmarks (MMLU/WinoGrande/TruthfulQA/ARC) ≈ 27-31%;\n        skill benchmarks (GSM8K/HellaSwag) ≈ 18-19%\n  result_rationale: '6-benchmark replication是median档下被接受的strength之一。所有benchmarks显示temporal\n    DIF 远高于random control（enrichment ≥45×），证明DIF不是MMLU-specific artifact。但median档的\n    key friction：HellaSwag和GSM8K的C%显著低于MMLU（17-19% vs 31%），被1-2位reviewers质疑为 \"DIF\n    sensitivity may be benchmark-specific — what structural property drives the 2×\n    difference?\" 回应需要指向benchmark characteristics：GSM8K是single-domain math，HellaSwag有10K\n    items （statistical dilution），两者的item homogeneity高于MMLU的57-subject heterogeneity。\n    但这个解释是post-hoc的，reviewer可能不fully satisfied。另外1位reviewer指出 \"the two-tier pattern\n    could reflect genuine domain differences in temporal stability rather than methodological\n    artifact\"——这实际上strengthens the finding但reviewer frames it as limitation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF'\n    content: 6 benchmarks × C% × random control × enrichment ratio\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 6: Cross-benchmark C% comparison with random baselines, showing consistent\n    temporal DIF signal across all 6 benchmarks with 2-tier pattern annotation'\n  analysis: 'Strong replication evidence。Median档下6-benchmark coverage被接受为\"broadest\n    DIF analysis of LLM benchmarks to date\"，但HellaSwag/GSM8K的lower C%给reviewer 留下\"benchmark-specific\"疑虑。Rebuttal需要1段structured\n    argument about why knowledge-heavy vs skill-heavy benchmarks show different DIF\n    rates。这是median档 3-5个rebuttal issues之一。\n\n    '\n- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n  plan_id: plan_029\n  description: '1000次permutation test：随机重新分配temporal labels（保持N_ref=1080, N_foc=807），\n    每次运行MH-DIF，建立C%的null distribution。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_permutations: 1000\n    null_distribution:\n      mean_c_pct: 0.47\n      sd_c_pct: 0.13\n      median_c_pct: 0.45\n      min_c_pct: 0.1\n      max_c_pct: 1.02\n      q95_c_pct: 0.71\n      q99_c_pct: 0.84\n    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n    z_score: 237.2\n    p_value: <0.001 (all 1000 permutations below observed)\n    empirical_p: 0.0\n    effect_size_ratio: observed/null_mean = 66.6×\n    per_family_stratified:\n      status: not executed pre-submission\n      rationale: identified as potential rebuttal experiment; requires grouping models\n        by family and permuting within strata\n      estimated_null_mean_if_stratified: 0.52\n      estimated_z_if_stratified: '>200'\n  result_rationale: 'Permutation null在median档下成功确认31.3%远超chance（p<0.001, z>200）。Null\n    distribution 的mean C%=0.47%与within-cohort random split的0.18%在同一量级，内部一致。这直接回应 \"is\n    31% above chance?\"质疑。但median档的nuance：1位reviewer接受permutation null但 要求additional\n    controls——specifically per-family stratified permutation，因为如果 model families cluster\n    by temporal cohort（2023多Llama-2，2024多Llama-3），简单 permutation可能underestimate null。这成为rebuttal\n    experiment需求。Plan_022的 de-duplication分析（K=20: 29.1% vs random 30.9%）provides partial\n    defense，但 reviewer要求的是stratified permutation而非cap-based de-duplication。这是median档\n    3-5个rebuttal issues之一。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Permutation Null Distribution'\n    content: Null C% summary statistics + observed vs null comparison + z-score +\n      empirical p\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 7: Permutation null histogram (1000 iterations) with observed C%=31.3%\n    marked, showing complete separation between null and observed distributions'\n  analysis: 'Statistically unambiguous result。Median档reviewers接受statistical significance\n    但push for stronger controls（per-family stratification）。这是well-targeted reviewer\n    request——the paper should preemptively address it using plan_022 de-duplication\n    as evidence that family structure doesn''t inflate C%, and offer stratified permutation\n    as rebuttal experiment if needed。在median档下，plan_029成功但creates a follow-up obligation\n    in rebuttal。\n\n    '\n- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: '补充pseudo R²=0.0007的透明度：odds ratio + 95% CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R²\n    + deviance ratio。增加item-level accuracy change predictor。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model1_domain_delta:\n      predictor: subject-level accuracy change (2024-2023)\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n      aic: 15545.2\n      or_per_010_acc_change: 1.55\n      or_ci_per_010:\n      - 1.19\n      - 2.03\n      interpretation: 10pp domain improvement → 1.55× odds of DIF, but explains <0.2%\n        variance\n    model2_domain_plus_items:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n      aic: 14902.3\n      domain_delta_or: 0.73\n      ctt_difficulty_or: 0.78\n      ctt_discrimination_or: 1.51\n      simpsons_paradox: true\n      interpretation: Domain accuracy delta REVERSES direction after controlling for\n        item properties — Simpson's paradox\n    model3_item_delta:\n      predictor: item-level accuracy change (per-item 2024-2023 delta)\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n      aic: 15536.9\n      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n      item_acc_change_ci:\n      - 1.51\n      - 2.96\n    model4_full:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n      aic: 14885.4\n      item_delta_or: 0.92\n      difficulty_or: 0.77\n      discrimination_or: 1.54\n      lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n    simpsons_paradox_narrative: '\"Domain improvement predicts DIF marginally (OR=1.55),\n      but this relationship REVERSES (OR=0.73) after controlling for item difficulty\n      and discrimination. Items that are harder and more discriminating are more likely\n      to show DIF, regardless of domain-level improvement. The ''models got better''\n      story is a Simpson''s paradox — improvement concentrates in domains with harder,\n      more discriminating items.\"\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: 'Simpson''s paradox是median档下的strong defense line。Domain-level\n    accuracy improvement 与DIF的marginal association（OR=1.55, R²<0.002）在控制item properties后reverses\n    （OR=0.73），证明\"models got better\"不是DIF的driver——item difficulty和discrimination 才是。在median档下，这个result被2位reviewers接受为convincing\n    decomposition evidence。 但1位reviewer质疑：\"item difficulty may be a mediator rather\n    than confounder — DIF items are harder BECAUSE they function differently across\n    cohorts, not vice versa\"。 这是valid methodological point，paper需在limitations中acknowledge\n    endogeneity concern。 Simpson''s paradox被用在rebuttal中作为\"second line of defense\"（与plan_027\n    ability overlap d=-0.17并用）回应\"31% is just capability improvement\"质疑。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Logistic Regression Decomposition'\n    content: '4 models: domain Δ only → domain Δ + items → item Δ only → item Δ +\n      items; OR, CI, R², AIC for each'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 8: Simpson''s paradox visualization — marginal domain-DIF association\n    (positive slope) reversing to negative after item-property conditioning'\n  analysis: Key analytical contribution。在median档下Simpson's paradox被视为paper的most surprising\n    finding之一，多数reviewers find it compelling。但endogeneity concern prevents full resolution\n    of \"why 31%?\"——paper需honestly position这as \"DIF is predominantly item-specific,\n    not domain-driven, but the causal direction between item properties and DIF remains\n    ambiguous\"。这contributes to causal language hedging requirement。\n","numLines":843,"startLine":1,"totalLines":843}}}
