{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01S3y9zLNaNmpPvXsdNvAx3W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Step 2 交叉分享完成。两位 Reviewer 已互读评审并回应。进入 Step 3 收敛和 Step 4 综合报告。\n\n关键收敛点：\n- 两位均给出 Overall 3.5（Borderline Conference）\n- 三大必修问题达成共识：(1) 多维性问题, (2) ConStat/DVD 直接比较, (3) 时间窗口敏感性\n- R2 在交叉后认可 R1 的多维性分析是\"两份评审中最强的技术论点\"\n- 两位均认为 Simpson's paradox 是最新颖的分析贡献\n\n现在生成最终综合报告并提交。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3786,"cache_read_input_tokens":61130,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3786},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce551a50-54ba-4aaa-8fff-25f5094463ff","uuid":"f3272613-befc-4a37-9e92-df8635c22079"}
