{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013FFpAVrLBp9z2KfwDqgo6u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"审稿报告已提交。\n\n**综合评分：3.5（Borderline Conference / Strong Findings）**\n\n两位 Reviewer 从不同角度（R1 方法+实验，R2 新颖性+相关工作）独立评审后均给出 3.5，经交叉讨论后维持不变。\n\n三大必修修改项达成共识：\n1. **多维性鲁棒性**（CFI=0.681，within-subject C%=38.1% 高于整体 31.3%，提示 total-score conditioning 可能引入 artifact）\n2. **ConStat/DVD 直接比较**（两位均独立提出；概念论证不够，需在同一 METABENCH 数据上运行）\n3. **时间窗口敏感性**（6 个月窗口 C%=34.35% 高于全年 31.3%，需解释）\n\n论文距 Findings 接收较近，距 Main 仍需补实验（ConStat 对比、多维性模拟、审计协议验证、per-family 分层置换检验）。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4715,"cache_read_input_tokens":66264,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4715},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce551a50-54ba-4aaa-8fff-25f5094463ff","uuid":"5bbdf78e-b870-4438-a7e9-b0569caf8b7e"}
